### Bug Analysis

#### Bug Scenario Description
The bug occurs when using the `SelectableTile` component for multi-selection with the shift key. When a user selects multiple tiles using shift-click, the last selected tile can lose its selected state, even though the `selected` prop indicates it should remain selected.

#### Bug Root Cause
The issue arises because the `handleClick` method in the `SelectableTile` component toggles the `selected` state without considering the `selected` prop. This causes the tile to be deselected when it should remain selected.

### Bug Location
The problem is located in the `handleClick` method of the `SelectableTile` component in `Tile.js`. The method currently toggles the `selected` state without checking the `selected` prop.

